      ],
      "text": "2.7.1 Summary of evidence and rationale",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        91.27869415283203,
        527.6161499023438,
        105.72169494628906
      ],
      "text": "Several clinical characteristics, conditions and comorbidities can indicate an increased risk for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        104.47870635986328,
        527.4024047851562,
        118.92170715332031
      ],
      "text": "developing TB disease or suffering worse outcomes from the disease, or both. Individuals identified",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        117.67871856689453,
        527.5731811523438,
        132.12171936035156
      ],
      "text": "as having untreated fibrotic lesions on CXR and who are not diagnosed with TB disease are at",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        128.08473205566406,
        527.407470703125,
        145.3217315673828
      ],
      "text": "(34–37) increased risk of developing TB disease  . These individuals are often identified through TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        144.07875061035156,
        527.0933227539062,
        158.52174377441406
      ],
      "text": "screening or clinical evaluation or during a clinical evaluation done for other reasons. Individuals",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        157.27870178222656,
        527.446533203125,
        171.72169494628906
      ],
      "text": "with other risk factors for TB or risk factors for poor outcomes from TB often can be identified most",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        198.30670166015625,
        167.68482971191406,
        232.48541259765625,
        184.86683654785156
      ],
      "text": "(38–66)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.989845275878906,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        237.4145050048828,
        170.36883544921875,
        272.02252197265625,
        184.7238311767578
      ],
      "text": "Table 2",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 10.989845275878906,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        170.4788360595703,
        527.4847412109375,
        184.9218292236328
      ],
      "text": "easily in health care settings  .   summarizes the evidence about the primary risk factors",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.989845275878906,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        183.67884826660156,
        527.4465942382812,
        198.12184143066406
      ],
      "text": "for TB and for poor health outcomes related to TB. Groups with other risk factors – such as people",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        196.87879943847656,
        527.4508666992188,
        211.32179260253906
      ],
      "text": "with malignancies and other disorders that compromise their immune system and people receiving",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        210.07875061035156,
        527.4135131835938,
        224.52174377441406
      ],
      "text": "immunomodulatory therapies – may also be prioritized, depending on the local epidemiology and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        223.27870178222656,
        205.94700622558594,
        237.72169494628906
      ],
      "text": "capacity of the health system.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        244.9827423095703,
        527.4058837890625,
        259.4257507324219
      ],
      "text": "This recommendation has not been changed from the 2013 guidelines because since the last GDG",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        258.18267822265625,
        527.1778564453125,
        272.6257019042969
      ],
      "text": "meeting, no new, robust evidence was found about the impact of systematic screening for TB disease",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.989444732666016,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        271.3826904296875,
        439.3145751953125,
        285.8257141113281
      ],
      "text": "compared with passive case-finding for screening of individuals with risk factors.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        299.5719299316406,
        490.52410888671875,
        314.43994140625
      ],
      "text": "Table 2. Risk factors for tuberculosis (TB) to be considered when prioritizing TB",
      "font": "MyriadPro-Bold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        313.9720153808594,
        337.791748046875,
        328.84002685546875
      ],
      "text": "screening among people attending for health care",
      "font": "MyriadPro-Bold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        76.785400390625,
        343.52813720703125,
        337.7294921875,
        357.37762451171875
      ],
      "text": "Risk factor Risk of TB or of poor outcomes",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Bold",
      "size": 10.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        76.785400390625,
        362.76300048828125,
        494.6153564453125,
        376.54949951171875
      ],
      "text": "Fibrotic lesions on  Studies have shown an increased risk of developing TB disease among",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        76.785400390625,
        374.26300048828125,
        501.5252990722656,
        388.04949951171875
      ],
      "text": "chest X-ray individuals with fibrotic lesions identified on chest X-ray but who are not",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        184.2519989013672,
        385.76300048828125,
        305.1600036621094,
        399.54949951171875
      ],
      "text": "diagnosed with TB disease. a",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        76.785400390625,
        404.7458190917969,
        492.13525390625,
        418.5323181152344
      ],
      "text": "Diabetes mellitus  Systematic reviews have found that the risk of TB for patients with DM",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        76.785400390625,
        416.2458190917969,
        503.3659362792969,
        430.0323181152344
      ],
      "text": "(DM) ranges from 1.5 to 2.0 to 3.1, with a decreasing risk in patients with well-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        184.2519989013672,
        427.7458190917969,
        506.4781188964844,
        441.5323181152344
      ],
      "text": "controlled DM. Patients with DM were also at an increased risk of relapse,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        184.2519989013672,
        439.2458190917969,
        311.3275146484375,
        453.0323181152344
      ],
      "text": "treatment failure and death. b",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        76.785400390625,
        458.22869873046875,
        519.5811767578125,
        472.01519775390625
      ],
      "text": "Previous TB Patients with a history of TB are at increased risk of subsequent TB episodes,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        184.2519989013672,
        469.72869873046875,
        405.5114440917969,
        483.51519775390625
      ],
      "text": "poor outcomes and developing drug-resistant TB. c",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        76.785400390625,
        488.71160888671875,
        514.897216796875,
        502.49810791015625
      ],
      "text": "Chronic lung disease Studies have found hazard ratios for developing TB among individuals with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        184.2519989013672,
        500.21160888671875,
        407.8518371582031,
        513.9981079101562
      ],
      "text": "COPD ranging from 2.5 in China to 3.0 in Sweden. d",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        76.785400390625,
        519.1943969726562,
        492.3620300292969,
        532.9808959960938
      ],
      "text": "Smoking Systematic reviews have found that people who smoke or who have a",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        184.2519989013672,
        530.6943969726562,
        507.21221923828125,
        544.4808959960938
      ],
      "text": "history of smoking have an increased risk of TB, with the RR ranging from",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        184.2519989013672,
        542.1943969726562,
        509.86553955078125,
        555.9808959960938
      ],
      "text": "1.5 to 2.0 to 3.3; smokers are also at an increased risk of drug-resistant TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        184.2519989013672,
        553.6943969726562,
        440.4609680175781,
        567.4808959960938
      ],
      "text": "and poor outcomes from TB, including relapse and death. e",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        76.785400390625,
        574.4944458007812,
        514.2125854492188,
        588.2809448242188
      ],
      "text": "Alcohol use disorder Systematic reviews have found a 1.35 to 1.9 RR associated with alcohol use",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        184.2519989013672,
        585.9944458007812,
        517.6722412109375,
        599.7809448242188
      ],
      "text": "and a 3 to 3.33 RR associated with alcohol use disorder, as well as increased",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        184.2519989013672,
        597.4944458007812,
        478.7487487792969,
        611.2809448242188
      ],
      "text": "risks of treatment failure and development of drug-resistant TB. An",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        184.2519989013672,
        608.9944458007812,
        513.8482666015625,
        622.7809448242188
      ],
      "text": "exposure–response analysis showed that for every 10–20 g of daily alcohol",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        184.2519989013672,
        620.4944458007812,
        373.3016357421875,
        634.2809448242188
      ],
      "text": "intake, there was a 12% increase in TB risk. f",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        76.785400390625,
        639.4773559570312,
        491.0484619140625,
        653.2638549804688
      ],
      "text": "Substance use  People with substance use disorder are at increased risks of treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        76.785400390625,
        650.9773559570312,
        508.2706298828125,
        664.7638549804688
      ],
      "text": "disorder failure, development of drug resistance, and mortality from TB due to low",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        184.2519989013672,
        662.4773559570312,
        518.3648681640625,
        676.2638549804688
      ],
      "text": "adherence and coincident clinical, socioeconomic and structural risk factors. g",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        76.785400390625,
        684.4773559570312,
        521.2506103515625,
        698.2638549804688
      ],
      "text": "Malnourishment A systematic review found that lower BMI is associated with an increased risk",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        184.2519989013672,
        695.9773559570312,
        508.4656982421875,
        709.7638549804688
      ],
      "text": "of TB, with a reduction in TB incidence of 13.8% (95% confidence interval:",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        184.2519989013672,
        707.4773559570312,
        508.65179443359375,
        721.2638549804688
      ],
      "text": "13.4–14.2) per unit increase in BMI within the range 18.5–30 kg/m . There  2",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        184.2519989013672,
        718.9773559570312,
        498.878173828125,
        732.7638549804688
      ],
      "text": "are multiple pathways by which undernourishment can increase the risk",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        184.2519989013672,
        730.4773559570312,
        509.2605895996094,
        744.2638549804688
      ],
      "text": "of TB, including cell-mediated immunity and micronutrient deficiency, and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        184.2519989013672,
        741.9773559570312,
        513.1719360351562,
        755.7638549804688
      ],
      "text": "other conditions can increase the risk of malnourishment and TB, including",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        184.2519989013672,
        753.4773559570312,
        376.5525817871094,
        767.2638549804688
      ],
      "text": "mental health and substance use disorders. h",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        796.217041015625,
        136.43409729003906,
        806.7210083007812
      ],
      "text": "WHO consolidated",
